  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Bring a large saucepan of salted water to the boil for the ravioli. Finely chop the onion. Coarsely chop the walnuts (see Make it yours).",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1341070/photos/large/238441_1-8158fcf9a89688f5d7cbbb3a5f56de86.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook ravioli: Cook the ravioli in the pan of boiling water for 3 mins or until al dente. Reserve 60ml (¼ cup) cooking water, then drain the ravioli.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1341071/photos/large/238441_2-850f5fbc8cd6dd7c50e02cbe4a9f9753.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Start sauce: Meanwhile, heat 2 tsp olive oil in a medium deep frypan over medium heat. Cook the onion, stirring, for 3-4 mins until softened. Add the Tuscan seasoning and 2 tbs tomato paste and cook, stirring, for 1 min or until fragrant.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1341072/photos/large/238441_3-2c58eb29d3998115e8ac9b804a063ea5.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Finish sauce: Stir the reserved cooking water, spinach and half the cream into the sauce and cook for 2-3 mins until thickened. Add the ravioli and gently stir to coat. Remove the pan from the heat. Taste, then season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1341073/photos/large/238441_4-67748553711fa9d215a8955141720ff9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Divide the ravioli among plates and scatter with the walnuts. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1341074/photos/large/238441_5-5ee6b0c70f3ef80250ea13bfc891742f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: If you have the time and want to add a little more crunch, toast the walnuts before chopping them. Put the walnuts in a cold small frypan over medium heat and toast, tossing, for 3-4 mins until golden. Remove from the pan, then coarsely chop before scattering over your pasta.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1341075/photos/large/238441_6-6008943387a372362a097cc2b5e7fe2e.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
